title: "Handmade Copper Awnings, Fabricated in New Orleans"
description: "Copper awnings for windows and doors, chimney caps, cupolas, leader heads, louvers and vents, fabricated in-house in New Orleans from natural copper sheet. Call 1-877-251-5327."
preload: /assets/img/hero-awning-brick.webp
preloadSrcset: "/assets/img/hero-awning-brick-800.webp 800w, /assets/img/hero-awning-brick.webp 1600w"
